.TH VC4-SMI 1 "2026-11-20" "vc4-stack" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
vc4-smi \- one-shot VideoCore IV status summary
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vc4-smi
[\fB\-\-json\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B vc4-smi
prints state, QPU utilisation, the stock core/V3D clocks, temperature, throttle
bits, CMA memory, QPU state and the processes attached to
.IR /run/vc4d.sock .
It is a thin wrapper over
.BR "vc4top \-\-once"
with
.BR NO_COLOR=1 ,
plus the read-only
.I /sys/kernel/vc4mon
register window.
.PP
It never opens
.I /dev/mem
and never writes a register.  It changes no clock, governor or voltage.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-json
Print one JSON object instead of the table.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 when the GPU is healthy; 1 when a current throttle bit is set, the firmware
reports undervoltage, the scheduler queue reports an error, or ERRSTAT has
bits other than VCD-idle; 2 on a usage error or when vc4top is missing.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR vc4-query (1),
.BR vc4top (1),
.BR vc4infer (1)
